      "writtenOn": "2024-03-06T08:56:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In the CTS change CL (aosp/2897513) we will need the flag to determine whether TrafficStats#clearRateLimitCaches() is supported.\n * If supported but not called, the stats doesn\u0027t update and test fails.\n * If not supported but called, NoSuchMethod exception is raised.\n * If feature disabled but called, no harm.\n \nWhile in aosp the version check always return false (34_00 \u003c 34_18), we\u0027ll need to \ncheck this flag in the production code as well to prevent from case 1.",
      "parentUuid": "2f3e0983_b6a3c3bc",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 55,
        "startChar": 29,
        "endLine": 55,
        "endChar": 67
      },
      "revId": "615287947e1dd2ce84d4e75a8ebb5d4c88036f3a",
