      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think it\u0027s better not to spy since Dependencies already allow us to inject some behavior for testing.\n\n`supportTrafficStatsRateLimitCache` can return value set by some method like \n`setSupportTrafficStatsRateLimitCache(boolean enabled)`.",
